# lsregrd.cf -- negative control for the EPSI1 patch in prn1_coeff()
# (t_pgen.c): a genuinely rank-deficient fit (X2 is exactly 2*X1, a
# perfect linear dependency between predictors, with real, non-zero
# residual variance from Y so this isolates rank-deficiency specifically
# from the separate near-zero-residual case in lsregsg.cf/.ref) must
# still print "---" after the patch. Genuine singularity is caught
# separately and earlier, algebraically, via lsreg()'s own rank check
# (ranka != nx1 - ranke forces cov = df = 0), independent of the se[j]
# threshold this patch changed. See lsregsc.cf/.ref for the positive
# case this patch actually fixes.

nvar(
    dfile = rankdef.dat,
    X1 = c1,
    X2 = c2,
    Y  = c3,
);
lsreg (
) = Y,X1,X2;
